# AMReX's FFT Poisson solver, on a single level of uniform cells. Grid_solvePoisson
# (Grid/GridSolvers/Amrex) uses it instead of multigrid when gr_amrexPoisson_useFFT is true, and
# setup includes it with AmrexFFT=True. AMReX must be 25.00 or later and built with FFT (configure
# --enable-fft=yes), which gr_amrexFFTPoissonFi.cxx checks at compile time; the site's Makefile.h
# must define CFLAGS_FFTW and LIB_FFTW.

LIBRARY fftw
PPDEFINE FLASHX_AMREX_FFT

D gr_amrexPoisson_useFFT Solve Grid_solvePoisson with AMReX's FFT solver rather than multigrid.
D & It needs a single level, and treats the boundary conditions as homogeneous, as multigrid does.
PARAMETER gr_amrexPoisson_useFFT BOOLEAN FALSE
